Subject: [PATCH 3/3] IDM: a lead on a one-point lookahead path is as far away as the point

Crash fix. IDM.update measures how far a lead car is along the agent's lookahead path from the
cumulative lengths of its segments, and pads that with its last entry. When the agent is one point
from its path's end, the lookahead path has a single point and no segment: the lengths are empty,
the pad is empty, and a car standing within lead_distance_threshold of that point indexes an empty
tensor -- IndexError in the simulator, and the episode dies with no score
(agent_controller.py:170, nuscenes scene-0166-medium-01: both attempts, at step 60, with released
Drive-JEPA's car standing there).

Fix: in that one case only, the lead's distance is the agent's distance to the point. Every other
path is upstream's code unchanged, so an episode where this never happens is unchanged. With it,
scene-0166-medium-01 ran to the end: steps 0-59 identical to the crashed attempt (ego path and all
30 model calls), then on past step 60 (HD-Score 0.501, 400 steps).

Not reachable from outside: the crash is inside the simulator's own agent planner. Upstreamable.

diff --git a/sim/utils/agent_controller.py b/sim/utils/agent_controller.py
index a7ff993..fe1a27b 100644
--- a/sim/utils/agent_controller.py
+++ b/sim/utils/agent_controller.py
@@ -166,7 +166,12 @@ class IDM:
             lookahead_lengths = torch.cumsum(torch.norm(
                 lookahead_path[1:, :2] - lookahead_path[:-1, :2], dim=1
             ), dim=0)
-            lookahead_lengths = torch.cat([lookahead_lengths, lookahead_lengths[-1:]])
+            if lookahead_lengths.numel():
+                lookahead_lengths = torch.cat([lookahead_lengths, lookahead_lengths[-1:]])
+            else:
+                # A one-point lookahead path (this agent is one point from its path's end): no segment to
+                # sum, so the lead on that point is as far away as the point is.
+                lookahead_lengths = torch.norm(lookahead_path[:1, :2] - state[None, :2], dim=1).clamp(min=1e-6)
             lead_distance = lookahead_lengths[indices_lead]
 
             # compute lead speed
